00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:59.510
you might be faced with a lot
of different product choices

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:03.360
or icons, and you might
not be sure where to start.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:06.500
So OK, I've got the idea
